  "duration_s": 166.485011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "不喝就是看不起我，领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪儿敢啊？我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。领导，您看鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的，年天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教。不是领导，您是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。小王，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒。我先敬，您来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。哎呀，您都说了，不是外人来，一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。请进小王最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过。我领导的格局值得我们学习啊。小王啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。小王啊，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本把话说的恰到好处，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里，有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，真是让我欲解心开呀。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1930,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2410,
      "end_ms": 2890,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3250,
      "end_ms": 4310,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4630,
      "end_ms": 5695,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9110,
      "end_ms": 9930,
      "text": "打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10030,
      "end_ms": 10750,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11070,
      "end_ms": 11470,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11530,
      "end_ms": 12370,
      "text": "我哪儿敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12470,
      "end_ms": 14830,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14830,
      "end_ms": 16430,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16750,
      "end_ms": 18230,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19190,
      "end_ms": 20090,
      "text": "鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20590,
      "end_ms": 21710,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21870,
      "end_ms": 22190,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22190,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "text": "您看鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 23850,
      "end_ms": 26490,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28350,
      "end_ms": 29550,
      "text": "年天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 29930,
      "end_ms": 30390,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 30570,
      "end_ms": 32010,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 32010,
      "end_ms": 32830,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 33010,
      "end_ms": 34750,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 34750,
      "end_ms": 38470,
      "text": "不是领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 38490,
      "end_ms": 39280,
      "text": "您是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 39700,
      "end_ms": 41240,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 41660,
      "end_ms": 42740,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 42980,
      "end_ms": 44180,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 46960,
      "end_ms": 47420,
      "text": "小王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 47700,
      "end_ms": 49260,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 49600,
      "end_ms": 51420,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 51420,
      "end_ms": 53980,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53980,
      "end_ms": 54460,
      "text": "我先敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 54460,
      "end_ms": 57460,
      "text": "您来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 57880,
      "end_ms": 58680,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 58680,
      "end_ms": 59440,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 59600,
      "end_ms": 60100,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 60240,
      "end_ms": 60820,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 60820,
      "end_ms": 61660,
      "text": "不是外人来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 61660,
      "end_ms": 62960,
      "text": "一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 63100,
      "end_ms": 65025,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 65350,
      "end_ms": 68370,
      "text": "请进小王最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 68470,
      "end_ms": 70210,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 70230,
      "end_ms": 71365,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 71740,
      "end_ms": 72420,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 72520,
      "end_ms": 73580,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 73580,
      "end_ms": 74945,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 76640,
      "end_ms": 77995,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 78310,
      "end_ms": 80150,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 80150,
      "end_ms": 84325,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 85670,
      "end_ms": 86305,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 86940,
      "end_ms": 88815,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 89820,
      "end_ms": 92395,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 92850,
      "end_ms": 94930,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 95010,
      "end_ms": 95590,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 95850,
      "end_ms": 97590,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 97690,
      "end_ms": 98665,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 98840,
      "end_ms": 101335,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 101600,
      "end_ms": 103180,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 103280,
      "end_ms": 105080,
      "text": "那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 105100,
      "end_ms": 106140,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 106180,
      "end_ms": 106860,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 106940,
      "end_ms": 107940,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 108180,
      "end_ms": 110465,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 110680,
      "end_ms": 112680,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 112860,
      "end_ms": 113680,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 113760,
      "end_ms": 115035,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 115210,
      "end_ms": 117905,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 118270,
      "end_ms": 119070,
      "text": "在这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 119070,
      "end_ms": 119590,
      "text": "有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 119590,
      "end_ms": 120495,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 120770,
      "end_ms": 120910,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 120910,
      "end_ms": 123255,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 123530,
      "end_ms": 124050,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 124370,
      "end_ms": 125410,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 125570,
      "end_ms": 127015,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 127410,
      "end_ms": 128770,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 128950,
      "end_ms": 130750,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 131010,
      "end_ms": 131970,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 132030,
      "end_ms": 134900,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 134900,
      "end_ms": 136180,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 136360,
      "end_ms": 137745,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 138080,
      "end_ms": 139580,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 139720,
      "end_ms": 141185,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 141570,
      "end_ms": 142790,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 142790,
      "end_ms": 144425,
      "text": "真是让我欲解心开呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 144820,
      "end_ms": 146205,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 146620,
      "end_ms": 150180,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 150360,
      "end_ms": 153405,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 153600,
      "end_ms": 155060,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 155400,
      "end_ms": 156900,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_74a64cf3aca9595d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 157040,
      "end_ms": 159335,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
